# uv is not this project pipeline: pyproject.toml declares scikit-build-core and
# CI installs with pip. A uv.lock in the tree is an artifact of someone running
# `uv run ruff` locally because ruff was not on PATH -- which is how 1016 lines
# of it rode into 65a1bb9 under `git add -A`, unmentioned.
uv.lock
